History: until 2026-08-27 this file carved out `streaming/patches/`
(GPL-3.0-or-later, patches against gpu-screen-recorder); that capture path was
removed in favour of the Rust sidecar. From 2026-07-25 to 2026-10-01 Pulse ran
under proprietary source-available licenses instead; since 2026-10-02 it is
back under the AGPL and no carve-out is needed.

Third-party components keep their own licenses
(overview: THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md in the repository root).
